  <p>If <b>name</b> does not exist, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/INVENTORY_NONE" target="_blank">INVENTORY_NONE</a> is returned (no errors or messages are generated), making this function ideal for testing the existence of a certain item in <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Inventory" target="_blank">inventory</a>.</p>
